= Hans von Seeckt

Hans von Seeckt was the chief of staff to Field Marshall August von Mackensen and, later, the Reichswehr. He modernized and reorganized our army, using clever tricks to get around the liminations of Versailles.

- @military_affairs
- @anti-semitic_campaign
- @schacht_plan
- @root: Return to main

@military_affairs
title: Military affairs
subtitle: We can set our military policy.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and spd_in_government and reichswehr_minister_party == dvp_name
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not dvp_in_government : The <span style="color: var(--dvp-color);">**[+ dvp_name +]**</span> is not in government. ?][? if reichswehr_minister_party != dvp_name: The <span style="color: var(--dvp-color);">**[+ dvp_name +]**</span> does not have the Reichswehr ministry. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: military_policy


@anti-semitic_campaign
title: Campaign for antisemitism
subtitle: Let us use the stab-in-the-back to our advantage.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; old_middle_dvp += 3*(1-dissent); rural_dvp += 2*(1-dissent); nationalism += 2*(1-dissent); pro_republic -= 2*(1-dissent); nationalist_strength += 5*(1-dissent)

We use the sporadic antisemitism to our advantage, challenging the <span style="color: #3f7bc1;">**DNVP**</span> and the <span style="color: #954B00;">**nazis**</span>.


@schacht_plan
title: Support Schacht's economic plan
subtitle: Call for a mass remilitarization plan.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0 and schacht_plan_adopted = 0 and black_thursday_seen = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] [? if lautenbach_plan_adopted > 0 : We have already adopted Lautenbach's economic plan. ?] [? if black_thursday_seen == 0 : We are not currently in an economic crisis. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6
go-to: crisis_program.support_schacht
